    "comments": {
      "/": {
        "comment0": "\t \t ======================= >>>>>>>>> An Example Versal Embedded Common Platform <<<<<<<<< =======================\n\t Note:\n\t --> Board preset applied to PS_WIZARD and memory controller settings\n\t --> AI Engine control path is connected to PS_WIZARD\n\t --> V++ will connect AI Engine data path automatically\n\t --> Execute TCL command : launch_simulation -scripts_only ,to establish the sim_1 source set hierarchy after successful design creation."
      }
    },
